# LC and NSF in Phase 2: Library To Participate in Digital Library Initiative.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
Discusses sponsorship by the Library of Congress (LC) for the National Science Foundation's (NSF) Digital Libraries Initiative--Phase 2, which is supporting innovative digital-library research and applications. The objective of the multiyear program is to provide leadership in research fundamental to the next generation of digital libraries. (LRW)

